# Generated dependency and build trees are not security-review source.
**/node_modules/
**/target/
**/dist/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.obj
**/*.pdb
**/*.exe
**/*.msi
**/*.zip
**/*.tar.gz
**/src-tauri/resources/arduino-toolchain/
